---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Card from "../components/Card.astro";

// Hero taglines. One renders by default (for no-JS and SEO); a small inline
// script swaps in a random one per visit.
const taglines = [
  "A healthcare AI company built around partnership and patient reality.",
  "Clinical AI for the patients the health system reaches last.",
  "Healthcare AI that meets patients where they actually are.",
  "Clinical AI, built for real patients and deployed in real care.",
  "Healthcare AI for the people most health tech is never designed for.",
];
---

<Base
  title="About · Pereste"
  description="Pereste Health Inc. is a Louisiana-based healthcare AI company building and deploying clinical AI solutions in partnership with institutions."
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="About Pereste"
    title="A healthcare AI company built around partnership and patient reality."
    lede="Pereste is a Louisiana-based healthcare AI company. We design clinical AI for the patients hardest to reach, and partner with the institutions already serving them to deploy it."
  />

  <script is:inline define:vars={{ taglines }}>
    const heading = document.querySelector("h1");
    if (heading && taglines.length) {
      heading.textContent =
        taglines[Math.floor(Math.random() * taglines.length)];
    }
  </script>

  <Section bordered>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10" data-reveal>
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why Pereste exists</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6">
        <p class="lede">
          Across rural America, the patients who need follow-through the most
          are the ones the system reaches the least. Between visits, care plans
          go unread and questions go unanswered, and people end up back in the
          hospital, not for lack of effort, but for lack of anything built for
          them.
        </p>
        <p class="lede">
          We started Pereste to close that gap: clinical AI that adapts to the
          person in front of it, deployed inside the institutions already doing
          the work. We're rooted in Louisiana, among the hardest-hit states in
          the nation for diabetes, health literacy, and access to care, and
          building exactly where the need is greatest.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="subtle">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4" data-reveal>What we do</p>
    <h2 class="max-w-3xl mb-6" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:60ms">
      We build the AI, and we deploy it where patients already get care.
    </h2>
    <p class="lede max-w-2xl mb-12" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
      Our first product, Guide, is a voice-first companion that turns a
      patient's own discharge papers, lab results, and care plan into a calm,
      plain-language conversation at their own reading level. Building it takes
      two things, tightly coupled: we develop the adaptive clinical AI behind
      Guide, and we deploy it inside the hospitals and clinics already caring
      for patients, running on their systems, under their governance, with no
      patient data sent to outside AI services.
    </p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <Card eyebrow="Model" title="AI that adapts to the patient, not the other way around." data-reveal>
        We develop the underlying AI: adaptive to each patient, grounded in
        clinical context, and trained to behave well when the stakes are real.
        Our work is protected by pending intellectual property.
      </Card>
      <Card eyebrow="Implementation" title="Deployed inside the institutions we partner with." data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms">
        Our solutions run where patient data already lives, under the
        governance the institution already trusts. No PHI egress, no parallel
        infrastructure to maintain.
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bordered>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10" data-reveal>
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <p class="eyebrow">Where we're going</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6">
        <p class="lede">
          Our product, <a href="/guide" class="text-brand-ink underline decoration-brand-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand-ink">Guide</a>,
          covers six of the most common chronic conditions (type 2 diabetes,
          heart failure, chronic kidney disease, COPD, high blood pressure, and
          obesity), supporting patients between visits, when a care plan is
          most often misunderstood. The same patients, the same gap.
        </p>
        <p class="lede">
          Pereste is the company that holds that IP and brings Guide to the
          institutions ready to deploy it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-end" data-reveal>
      <div class="md:col-span-8">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Company</p>
        <h2 class="max-w-2xl">
          Pereste Health Inc. Founded and based in Louisiana.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-brand-ink/80">
          <li><span class="text-brand-muted">Entity:</span> Pereste Health Inc.</li>
          <li><span class="text-brand-muted">Headquarters:</span> Louisiana, USA</li>
          <li><span class="text-brand-muted">Stage:</span> Early, partnering with first deployment sites</li>
          <li><span class="text-brand-muted">Press / partnerships:</span> <a href="mailto:parker@pereste.com" class="link-arrow">Contact us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Base>
